viation_flags_90d 0 against 260 completed trips, EV-DPROF-02813) is noted. No driver compensation is due: this was an upfront-quoted trip, the rider was not billed by distance and no billed distance is recorded (distance_charged_km null), and the chat log carries no rider-requested detour (0 messages, EV-CHAT-02813). No endpoint was amended (POL-RD-05) and this is not a pooled trip (POL-RD-12, vehicle_type RYDE_X). The artifacts carrying the deciding facts - EV-FARE-02813 for the over-quote amount and EV-GPS-02813 with EV-TRIP-02813 for the excess - each carry weight 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) confidence cap is 1.0; the confidence of 0.90 sits below that cap and above the 0.70 floor. The refund of 6.80 does not exceed the SGD 8.00 POL-GEN-05 execution threshold, so it can be executed on issue."
